import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 157 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 157 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","no":157,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Origin Realm","Human Race","Male","Plane Transcendent","Cultivation Path"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","23-20% Activation Strategy"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0157_模块1-本源境-男性人族修炼路径.md","filePath":"en/0157_模块1-本源境-男性人族修炼路径.md"}'),o={name:"en/0157_模块1-本源境-男性人族修炼路径.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,u,m){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-157-origin-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" tabindex="-1">Entry 157 | Origin Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-157-origin-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 157 | Origin Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 23</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-cosmic-level-power-the-gatekeeper-of-myriad-races" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Cosmic-level power, the gatekeeper of Myriad Races <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-cosmic-level-power-the-gatekeeper-of-myriad-races" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Cosmic-level power, the gatekeeper of Myriad Races&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At the apex of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm system, the Origin Realm is the ninth realm and the true apex of the five mortal-cultivation and four sacred-cultivation realms. Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), the Origin Realm requires <strong>touching cosmic origin laws, understanding the cosmos&#39; ultimate operating laws, and being able to participate in the fine-tuning and optimization of cosmic laws</strong>. More critically — per the Plane Transcendent Standard (Document 17), <strong>the Origin Realm is precisely the threshold of &quot;Plane Transcendents&quot;</strong>: those who reach this realm are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s top-tier power, the core target group of the &quot;20% Activation Strategy.&quot;</p><p>This realm is fundamentally different from previous ones. Boundary-breaking and world creation are still &quot;operating within the cosmos&quot;; the Origin Realm requires the cultivator to <strong>become part of the cosmos&#39; origin</strong>. The six top-level axioms running through the text are no longer &quot;behavioral norms&quot; here, but &quot;identity definitions&quot;: the anti-predation axiom distinguishes &quot;Origin Realm strong ones&quot; from the predatory era&#39;s &quot;plane overlords&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires Origin Realm strong ones to be representatives of all races, not human privilege; the collective ascension axiom requires him to uplift Myriad Ranks not alone achieve immortality; the causal self-discipline axiom requires him not to disturb beings when fine-tuning laws; the law-first axiom requires the laws he touches to themselves be self-consistent. This entry focuses on the portrait of male humans pushing the Origin Realm; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Male humans who have come through Dao Integration, Boundary-Breaking, and World-Creation reach the critical point in both long boards and dark sides when pushing the Origin Realm:</p><ul><li><strong>Engineering–creation experience already sufficient</strong>: he has the ability to design a world; the next step is &quot;participating in designing the entire cosmos&#39; laws&quot;</li><li><strong>Authoritarian and control desire reach dangerous peak</strong>: those who can fine-tune cosmic laws most easily misread &quot;I can change it&quot; as &quot;I should decide alone&quot;</li><li><strong>Deduction and systems thinking</strong>: suited for cosmic-scale law deduction and engineering optimization</li><li><strong>Responsibility burden</strong>: male strong ones at this stage often face the tradeoff of &quot;whether to invest 30% of time in public responsibility&quot;</li></ul><p>Per Document 17, Origin Realm assessment is a <strong>four-dimensional assessment system</strong>: power 40%, mind 25%, contribution 20%, responsibility 15%. Male humans&#39; biggest challenge is not power (usually already sufficient), but mind and responsibility — precisely what predatory overlords lack and symbiotic Transcendents must have.</p><h2 id="ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-world-creation-to-origin" tabindex="-1">II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from World-Creation to Origin <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-world-creation-to-origin" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from World-Creation to Origin&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The standard chain for pushing the Origin Realm has four milestones:</p><ol><li><strong>Origin touch</strong>: rising from &quot;creating small worlds&quot; to &quot;feeling the breathing of the entire cosmic origin,&quot; understanding ultimate operating laws</li><li><strong>Law fine-tuning practice</strong>: under strict supervision, participating in cosmic-level law fine-tuning and optimization, accumulating operational records</li><li><strong>Cosmic-level mobilization</strong>: total energy reaches &quot;plane level&quot; — enough to support the basic law operation of a mid-size plane; energy purity 99%+</li><li><strong>Four-dimensional assessment met</strong>: power, mind, contribution, and responsibility all pass, formally recognized as a Plane Transcendent</li></ol><p>For male humans, the path must actively hedge three tendencies: first, <strong>greed for fine-tuning rights</strong>, treating &quot;participating in law optimization&quot; as &quot;I have the final say&quot;; second, <strong>evading public responsibility</strong>, feeling that having cultivated it he should monopolize it; third, <strong>disdaining mind</strong>, thinking power is enough. The four-dimensional assessment precisely places mind and responsibility (combined 40% weight) on equal footing with power.</p><h2 id="iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-temptation-of-immortality" tabindex="-1">III. Pain Points and Costs: The Temptation of Immortality <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-temptation-of-immortality" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Pain Points and Costs: The Temptation of Immortality&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Realm is the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon&#39;s ultimate eruption at the &quot;cosmic level&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Immortality temptation</strong>: life form near-immortal, can anchor life imprints in origin — male strong ones easily misread &quot;approaching immortality&quot; as &quot;can override all beings&quot;</li><li><strong>Authoritarian laws</strong>: holding law fine-tuning rights, one thought difference may affect billions of beings; slight deviation is causal disaster</li><li><strong>Responsibility burnout</strong>: required to invest 30% of time and energy annually in public responsibility (Document 17); strong ones easily develop &quot;why should I still work&quot; burnout</li><li><strong>Overlord afterimage</strong>: the predatory era&#39;s &quot;strongman takes all&quot; mindset recurs at cosmic scale</li></ul><p>Breakthrough costs: forcefully pushing the Origin Realm causes origin backlash from failed coupling with cosmic origin, at worst body-and-spirit annihilation. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision reach strictest in this realm: Origin Realm candidates must undergo consciousness deep scan, situational stress test, long-term observation, and dual gatekeeping by the Anchor Court ethics review committee and Symbiosis Court. This is not distrust, but acknowledging &quot;the hand that can fine-tune the cosmos must be the cleanest hand.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-world-level-power-to-cosmic-level-power" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;World-Level Power&quot; to &quot;Cosmic-Level Power&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-world-level-power-to-cosmic-level-power" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;World-Level Power&quot; to &quot;Cosmic-Level Power&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for male humans who pass the four-dimensional assessment and formally become Plane Transcendents:</p><ul><li>Touching cosmic origin, Dao is origin, origin is Dao</li><li>Energy purity 99%+, plane-level total, instant recovery possible</li><li>Life imprint anchored to this cosmos&#39; origin, near-immortal</li><li>Mind, contribution, responsibility three dimensions met, accepting annual 30% public responsibility obligation</li></ul><p>He is no longer &quot;a certain human strong one,&quot; but the gatekeeper of the Myriad Races republican civilization at cosmic level.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: channeling male cosmic-scale engineering deduction ability into law optimization and Myriad Races ascension, not monopolizing immortality</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the essential difference between Origin Realm strong ones and the predatory era&#39;s &quot;plane overlords&quot; — they guard the plane, not enslave it</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system, Transcendents relied on protagonist uniqueness and authoritarian cosmos; Heng Yuan Zhou Origin Realm strong ones are constrained by four-dimensional assessment and strongman mandatory service</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: male humans are only one group among Origin Realm candidates; the 20% Activation Strategy requires every race to have a Transcendent representative</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Origin Realm law fine-tuning experience and cosmic cognition are network-shared, laying the foundation for the Multiverse Realm&#39;s cross-cosmos governance</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Origin Realm is the apex of the nine realms, and the ultimate answer to the question &quot;whose servant is the strongman.&quot; Male humans reaching here, power is no longer the problem; the only question left is — will you use this cosmic-level power as heaven-emperor, or as gatekeeper? The four-dimensional assessment writes the answer into the institution: only those willing to bear responsibility for Myriad Races are worthy of standing at the cosmos&#39; apex.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const d=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,d as default};
